# Route: guide 27 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 50, 20 quests, 0.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Booty Bay -> Mistvale Valley -> Nek'mani
# Wellspring -> Booty Bay -> Wild Shore -> Jaguero Isle -> Booty Bay.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Monogrammed Sash (8552;
# Mok'rash 50); Facing Negolash (618; Negolash 52); Facing Negolash (8554;
# Negolash 52); Message in a Bottle (630; King Mukla 51).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

